     <td><para unique="1046360">AVX512F </para>
      <para unique="1046361">OR AVX10.1<anchor id="+241567"/></para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1046363">Convert sixteen packed unsigned doubleword integers from zmm2/m512/m32bcst to sixteen packed single precision floating-point values in zmm1 with writemask k1.</para>
      </td>
